{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1504835-essence-question-how-does-excellent-strike-actually-work","id":1504835,"title":"Essence Question: How does Excellent Strike actually work?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-03-08T05:24:32-08:00","id":1504835,"title":"Essence Question: How does Excellent Strike actually work?","content":"I am struggling with understanding how Excellent Strike works.<br /> <br /> If Excellent Strike doubles the remaining successes before adding bonus successes does this mean that if your rolled successes in themselves do not overcome Defense, it has no effect? Add to this that, as I understand it, Accuracy is considered a bonus success, so if you don't get to add that, then what? Also confusing to me is that, as I understand the Step system, you combine all successes before subtracting Defense so this seems to break the Step system.<br /> <br /> If anyone could explain this, I would be grateful.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Avatar by Raven &amp; Blue Jay.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/663-aleks","name":"Aleks","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar663_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"87"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-09T00:24:32-08:00","id":1504911,"title":"","content":"It does break the Step system in a way, but Charms have always been &quot;here's how your character cheats Fate.&quot;<br /> <br /> So basically, would go like this.<br /> <br /> 1) Attacker declares a withering attack with their straight sword.<br /> 2 ) Defender declares a Defense of 4.<br /> 3) Attacker spends 1m for Excellent Strike, then rolls Att+Close Combat for 6 successes resulting in 2 overflow. 2 overflow now count as 4. Attacker adds Accuracy for a fifth.<br /> <br /> Attacker gains 6 power. 1 for hitting, 4 for Excellent Strike, 1 for accuracy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-09T12:12:59-08:00","id":1504965,"title":"","content":"That is how I read it, too. I don't much like it, but then I don't have to.<br /> <br /> Thanks for your reply! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Avatar by Raven &amp; Blue Jay.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/663-aleks","name":"Aleks","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar663_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"87"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}